    "detailed_description": "Delve into the ancient catacombs and slay Eldritch beings as a cat crafting and wielding spells!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Crafting!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft spells with 85 different components!<br>Spells are made with 4 component types: Patterns, Shapes, Effects, and Mods.<br>Patterns determine how many effects or mods the spell can have and its firing mode.<br>Shapes change how the spell is delivered!<br>Effects effect what the spell does when it hits the target, freeze them, heal them, or even duplicate them!<br>Mods change various things about the spell. Make it bouncy, make it explode, make it pierce, etc!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Levels!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As of right now there are 4 dungeon types that you will slay your way through. The Hills, The Catacombs, the Caves, and the Sanguine Depths! Each level is procedurally generated!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Charms!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Charms let you passively fire spells when a condition is met! for example: When HP goes below 50% &gt; cast Self heal, or On Jump &gt; Cast Fire Area! You can equip up to 5 charms!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Altars!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Altars can be found throughout the dungeons and usually offer a benefit at a cost<br>The altar of corruption has a 75% chance to destroy your spell but a 25% chance to Greatly buff it!<br>The altar of binding lets you cast a spell on the impact of another spell!<br>The altar of sacrifice decreases one stat but greatly increases another<br>The altar of dismemberment can remove arms for stronger spells!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Movement!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Wall jump, slam, and slide your way through dungeons with immense slickness!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Nekonomicon</strong>!</u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Nekonomicon is a skill tree with some insane synergies! Bosses will drop knowledge that can be spent in the Nekonomicon when you die. Be careful though, as you progress so will your madness!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Cats!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unlock new cats with unique passives and different stats!",
    "about_the_game": "Delve into the ancient catacombs and slay Eldritch beings as a cat crafting and wielding spells!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Crafting!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cbef13493b9aa5a186e0dd0c350d147f.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft spells with 85 different components!<br>Spells are made with 4 component types: Patterns, Shapes, Effects, and Mods.<br>Patterns determine how many effects or mods the spell can have and its firing mode.<br>Shapes change how the spell is delivered!<br>Effects effect what the spell does when it hits the target, freeze them, heal them, or even duplicate them!<br>Mods change various things about the spell. Make it bouncy, make it explode, make it pierce, etc!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Levels!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/8401f72b3e019d3fe7c63903a22e14b8.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As of right now there are 4 dungeon types that you will slay your way through. The Hills, The Catacombs, the Caves, and the Sanguine Depths! Each level is procedurally generated!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Charms!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/ed8d1655561a6f0bea7449c4c0d02069.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Charms let you passively fire spells when a condition is met! for example: When HP goes below 50% &gt; cast Self heal, or On Jump &gt; Cast Fire Area! You can equip up to 5 charms!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Altars!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/d814c316e7e30deb5145ecc388064cb2.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Altars can be found throughout the dungeons and usually offer a benefit at a cost<br>The altar of corruption has a 75% chance to destroy your spell but a 25% chance to Greatly buff it!<br>The altar of binding lets you cast a spell on the impact of another spell!<br>The altar of sacrifice decreases one stat but greatly increases another<br>The altar of dismemberment can remove arms for stronger spells!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Movement!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/1a2d849ebeb3f87e14ba472f35234353.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Wall jump, slam, and slide your way through dungeons with immense slickness!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Nekonomicon</strong>!</u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/cc75beab0230b4084fea3990abcb0b03.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Nekonomicon is a skill tree with some insane synergies! Bosses will drop knowledge that can be spent in the Nekonomicon when you die. Be careful though, as you progress so will your madness!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Cats!</strong></u></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.poster.avif?t=1700823871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.webm?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093760/extras/a3396e416536ca754656108c49e1e861.mp4?t=1700823871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unlock new cats with unique passives and different stats!",
